{"h":3181,"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.11810550689697266,"x":0.097984167720455512,"c":1,"y":0.044615916255733468,"h":0.01660254914231607},{"t":"OFFICER:","h":0.010605530945629771,"c":1,"x":0.098206476743907062,"y":0.095714676371369212,"w":0.063702653249104818},{"w":0.053949902852376302,"y":0.11191860463220427,"h":0.008720930232558155,"x":0.10019267855621949,"t":"LOUISE:","c":1},{"x":0.098157023071805322,"w":0.063801561991373712,"y":0.12614582423665754,"c":1,"t":"OFFICER:","h":0.013696723281025891},{"w":0.053949902852376289,"x":0.10019267853527621,"y":0.15988372091465952,"h":0.008720930232558044,"c":1,"t":"LOUISE:"},{"t":"OFFICER:","h":0.011747091690149869,"y":0.27028924465718718,"c":1,"w":0.061696364084879565,"x":0.10017301339684755},{"y":0.28772222551772164,"w":0.053988539377848296,"h":0.0088578745076522969,"t":"LOUISE:","x":0.10017336029356851,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"OFFICER:","x":0.1001276266365453,"w":0.063713919321695969,"y":0.31813178295163991,"h":0.013445736101631134},{"t":"LOUISE.","x":0.10016168094119134,"w":0.054011898040771486,"c":1,"h":0.010363015942720377,"y":0.33566151526594834},{"h":0.013231568783053316,"w":0.063637854258219412,"t":"OFFICER:","c":1,"x":0.098238876940535957,"y":0.35021561079237118},{"w":0.053949902852376289,"h":0.008720930232558155,"y":0.36773255812396188,"c":1,"t":"LOUISE:","x":0.10019267853527621},{"h":0.013793634813885403,"c":1,"t":"OFFICER:","x":0.10006710624814381,"y":0.38191132202272615,"w":0.063834959665934235},{"x":0.10019267852371551,"y":0.39970930230523249,"w":0.053949902852376316,"c":1,"h":0.010174418604651181,"t":"LOUISE:"},{"t":"OFFICER:","y":0.41424418588299416,"w":0.063583812713623039,"x":0.098265897713516015,"h":0.013081395348837122,"c":1},{"y":0.43168604648950959,"w":0.053949902852376302,"h":0.010174418604651292,"c":1,"t":"LOUISE:","x":0.10019267855621949},{"c":1,"t":"OFFICER:","x":0.098213658612046589,"y":0.44607501310052222,"h":0.013373229280348342,"w":0.063688290913899742},{"h":0.008720930232558155,"t":"LOUISE:","w":0.053949902852376302,"y":0.47965116277392661,"c":1,"x":0.10019267852786551},{"y":0.092108516619997416,"c":1,"t":"Yes. So you say the theft occurred yesterday?","x":0.19450619561882651,"w":0.35861462910970054,"h":0.017289120921692991},{"t":"Yes.","x":0.19495694908567199,"y":0.10966746991370546,"h":0.014499431732388768,"c":1,"w":0.037643785476684566},{"h":0.015961458816384444,"t":"So that was September the tenth. And do you have any idea at all of where or","x":0.19455521458206135,"y":0.12476941466672375,"w":0.60511403401692709,"c":1},{"w":0.0250481700897216,"h":0.013081395348837233,"t":"Q6","y":0.12354651156249996,"x":0.83622350639059206,"c":1},{"w":0.38743169148763024,"h":0.01407335030815271,"y":0.14094996136220028,"c":1,"t":"when the things might possibly have been stolen?","x":0.19646077860556119},{"t":"Well at first I couldn't believe it because the bag had been on my back ever since I","h":0.014248674729573252,"y":0.15695859023427883,"x":0.19649564789132304,"w":0.62436045328776046,"c":1},{"y":0.17284726586775023,"t":"left the apartment after lunch. It's just a small backpack, but I generally use it when","x":0.19460501720901752,"h":0.013199245757385292,"c":1,"w":0.62620422363281247},{"x":0.19653178578378477,"t":"I'm travelling because it seems safer than a handbag. Anyway, I met up with a","c":1,"y":0.19040697674204154,"w":0.58959538777669263,"h":0.013081395348837233},{"t":"friend, and we spent a couple of hours in the museum. But I do remember that as Q7","w":0.66677744547526041,"x":0.19647875822896746,"h":0.015554818921236002,"y":0.2040885149025824,"c":1},{"t":"we were leaving there, at about 4 o'clock, a group of young boys ran up to us, and","x":0.19460501514753947,"y":0.22238372092741576,"w":0.62427744547526043,"h":0.014574167190446241,"c":1},{"y":0.23685631298960574,"w":0.66871775309244796,"h":0.018241192993317501,"t":"they were really crowding round us, and they were asking us what time it was, then Q8","c":1,"x":0.19263139574882415},{"h":0.013199245757385292,"t":"all of a sudden they ran off.","x":0.19653179155584893,"y":0.25424261470119025,"w":0.20809248606363934,"c":1},{"x":0.19653179423728231,"y":0.27027027026635375,"h":0.013199245757385292,"t":"Can you remember anything about them?","c":1,"w":0.32369941711425787},{"h":0.01803149913257962,"x":0.19453982328158342,"t":"The one who did most of the talking was wearing a T-shirt with a picture of","w":0.58011510213216155,"c":1,"y":0.28422373145488322},{"t":"something... let's see ... a tiger.","x":0.19653179439787474,"c":1,"w":0.25240847269694011,"h":0.013199245757385292,"y":0.30232558138893628},{"h":0.01606693903205525,"c":1,"y":0.3167818981717716,"w":0.37379575093587236,"t":"Right. Any idea of how old he might have been?","x":0.19460501463948846},{"w":0.19845856984456381,"y":0.33280955373194887,"x":0.19460501170679365,"c":1,"h":0.016027655562539267,"t":"Around twelve years old?"},{"x":0.1945072200830873,"w":0.4761410013834636,"y":0.34768930004645848,"c":1,"t":"And can you remember anything else about his appearance?","h":0.018515743301171006},{"t":"Not much. He was quite thin ...","h":0.013081395348837344,"w":0.24084777832031248,"x":0.19653179473783136,"c":1,"y":0.36627906976138558},{"t":"Colour of hair?","y":0.38214959144238603,"w":0.11753372192382811,"c":1,"x":0.19460500792055224,"h":0.011745757385292155},{"w":0.52601155598958338,"x":0.1946050118910666,"y":0.39817724701196933,"h":0.013199245757385292,"t":"I do remember that - he was blond. All the others were dark-haired.","c":1},{"x":0.83622350638898635,"y":0.39680232552688954,"h":0.013081395348837233,"c":1,"w":0.025048170089721711,"t":"Q9"},{"c":1,"x":0.1946050063035322,"y":0.41420490257093934,"h":0.014574167190446241,"t":"And any details of the others?","w":0.23506744384765624},{"w":0.33140655517578121,"c":1,"y":0.43023255813510364,"h":0.014534883720930258,"t":"Not really. They came and went so quickly.","x":0.19460500747602216},{"t":"Right. So what l'm going to do now is give you a crime reference number so you","x":0.19653179324407594,"y":0.44622093022972664,"w":0.62042388916015634,"c":1,"h":0.013081395348837233},{"c":1,"w":0.55876683553059903,"t":"can contact your insurance company. So this is ten digits: 87954 82361.","x":0.19460502155264861,"y":0.46220930232011714,"h":0.014534883720930147},{"x":0.19634141000477237,"y":0.47666179955248955,"w":0.20077009836832685,"h":0.015888907638156535,"c":1,"t":"Thank you. So should I ..."},{"h":0.015988372093023173,"t":"SECTION 2","x":0.10019267541018562,"y":0.5290697674310576,"w":0.15221580505371096,"c":1},{"w":0.69556838989257819,"c":1,"t":"Good morning everyone. My name's Janet Parker and I'm the human resources manager.","y":0.55813953464147292,"x":0.10211946327464877,"h":0.014534883720930258},{"x":0.098265887425011911,"y":0.57558139534585873,"w":0.7302504984537761,"h":0.014613450659962335,"c":1,"t":"We're very happy to welcome you to your new apprenticeship. I hope that the next six months"},{"x":0.098265891582184489,"y":0.59145191702913569,"t":"will be a positive and enjoyable experience for you.","h":0.014770584538026377,"w":0.40077072143554693,"c":1},{"x":0.098265906128867569,"c":1,"y":0.61470773098408171,"w":0.67630055745442708,"t":"I'd like to start with some general advice about being an apprentice. Most of you have very","h":0.016106222501571343},{"c":1,"t":"little or no experience of working for a big organisation and the first week or so may be quite","x":0.098265893022040987,"y":0.63073538654611661,"w":0.68786127726236979,"h":0.01606693903205525},{"y":0.6460699588518376,"h":0.017243056234363396,"t":"challenging. There will be a lot of new information to take in but don't worry too much about trying","x":0.098206502990804356,"c":1,"w":0.72652430216471353},{"t":"to remember everything. The important thing is to check with someone if you're not sure what to","c":1,"x":0.096339118265073007,"y":0.66279069767175391,"w":0.71868977864583328,"h":0.016027655562539267},{"h":0.017374563786610397,"t":"do - you'll find your supervisor is very approachable and won't mind explaining things or helping","x":0.098204605956848351,"y":0.6777601062471641,"w":0.71688863118489587,"c":1},{"x":0.098218360967017679,"w":0.68988143920898437,"y":0.69358764523215533,"h":0.017320652115951907,"t":"you out. You're here to learn so make the most of that opportunity. You'll be spending time in","c":1},{"w":0.67642430623372396,"t":"different departments during your first week so make an effort to talk to as many people as","h":0.016338946608010496,"x":0.098199729963429738,"y":0.71068231416703542,"c":1},{"t":"possible about their work - you'll make some new friends and find out lots of useful information.","c":1,"x":0.09821257693031242,"h":0.017423226951728599,"y":0.72653524988394846,"w":0.71494476318359379},{"y":0.74958867711655008,"h":0.018511286027621865,"t":"As well as having a supervisor, you'll each be assigned a mentor. This person will be someone","c":1,"x":0.098177724389332754,"w":0.71692871093749999},{"t":"who's recently completed an apprenticeship and you'll meet with them on a weekly basis. Their","x":0.098213172863829634,"y":0.76574140769945642,"h":0.017099788097523105,"c":1,"w":0.72071929931640621},{"t":"role is to provide help and support throughout your apprenticeship. Of course, this doesn't","y":0.78169877974078406,"w":0.68410466512044266,"x":0.096293920004777073,"h":0.016524807602110947,"c":1},{"h":0.017498844753339626,"y":0.79719718576307474,"c":1,"x":0.098199059910085304,"t":"mean they'll actually do any of your work for you - instead they'll be asking you about what","w":0.69377543131510422},{"x":0.096339120346726856,"t":"goals you've achieved so far, as well as helping you to identify any areas for improvement. You","y":0.81395348837001069,"w":0.72061655680338543,"h":0.014534883720930147,"c":1},{"w":0.50481694539388022,"t":"can also discuss your more long-term ambitions with them as well","h":0.014534883720930147,"x":0.09633911873690712,"y":0.82994186046208829,"c":1},{"w":0.036608864466349256,"y":0.7994186046126881,"t":"Q13","x":0.83429672373985042,"h":0.013081395348837122,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.83139534879873456,"h":0.013081395348837233,"t":"Q14","x":0.83429672373985042,"w":0.036608864466349256},{"h":0.017415848113994548,"y":0.87632890502281346,"w":0.69762171427408859,"c":1,"t":"Now I just want to run through a few company policies for our apprenticeship scheme with","x":0.098192926834255539},{"h":0.018323639366778055,"x":0.09628410739928768,"c":1,"t":"you... Most importantly, the internet. As part of your job you'll be doing some research online","y":0.89228679122134835,"w":0.71879745483398438},{"y":0.90980515398872008,"t":"so obviously you'll have unlimited access for that but please don't use it for personal use -","w":0.69942194620768228,"c":1,"h":0.014613450659962335,"x":0.096339123116574873},{"y":0.92397913001014564,"h":0.017685715767065013,"x":0.082713074476498089,"w":0.30086222330729162,"c":1,"t":"•you'll have your own phones for that."},{"h":0.013081395348837233,"w":0.026974951426188151,"y":0.95203488366642441,"x":0.094412331528395968,"c":1,"t":"198"},{"x":0.83429672487278161,"y":0.90988372088935321,"h":0.013081395348837122,"c":1,"t":"Q15","w":0.034682079950968392}]}